      "kind": "rule_paraphrase",
      "edition_ids": ["two-player-standard-en"],
      "topics": ["play", "lead", "running-total"],
      "summary": "Non-dealer leads; the players then alternate playing one card face-up in front of themselves and calling the new running total aloud. The running total may never exceed 31. Face cards each count 10 toward the total, number cards count their pip value, and Aces count 1.",
