    {
      "id": "pegging-pair-triplet-four",
      "title": "Pegging: pairs, triplets, and four of a kind",
      "kind": "scoring_atom",
      "edition_ids": ["two-player-standard-en"],
      "topics": ["pegging", "pair", "play"],
      "summary": "Matching the rank of the last card played scores 2 for a pair, 6 for a third card of the same rank in a row (triplet / pair royal), and 12 for a fourth in a row (double pair royal). Pairs match by rank only: a Jack pairs another Jack but does not pair a Queen even though both count 10 toward the running total.",
