      "topics": ["counting", "fifteen", "pair"],
      "summary": "Every distinct combination of cards from the five-card set that sums to 15 counts 2 points, and every distinct pair (two cards of the same rank) counts 2 points. Combinations are counted separately, so the same card can participate in more than one fifteen or pair.",
