      "summary": "Handy shortcuts for common combined patterns in a five-card show: three of a kind counts 6 (three pairs). Four of a kind counts 12 (six pairs). A three-card run with one rank duplicated (a 'double run') counts 8 (two runs of 3 plus a pair). A four-card run with one duplicated rank counts 10 (two runs of 4 plus a pair). A three-card run with one rank triplicated counts 15 (three runs of 3 plus a triplet). A three-card run with two different ranks duplicated counts 16 (four runs of 3 plus two pairs).",
